OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre reaches
OL,4,Aconstruction milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction of a #20m leisure centre
OL,7,Fis expected to be completed before the
OL,8,Fend of 2027, a district council has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FFacilities at the new Deal leisure
OL,12,Fcentre will include a six-lane swimming
OL,13,Fpool, gym, health and fitness studios,
OL,14,Fincluding a Pilates studio, a toddler
OL,15,Fsplash pad and cafe.
OL,17,FEnhanced accessibility provisions
OL,18,Finclude a new platform lift as well as
OL,19,Fa changing places toilet facility for
OL,20,Fdisabled people.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
