OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre reaches
OL,4,Aconstruction milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a topping out ceremony marked
OL,7,Fcompletion of the highest point of the
OL,8,Fbuilding this week, Dover District
OL,9,FCouncil leader Kevin Mills said
OL,10,F"excellent" progress had been made on
OL,11,Fthe construction of the centre.
